  "story": {
    "title": "The Thin Path",
    "bgm": "bgm_night",
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u03_1",
        "desc": "Evening in the Pair Forest. A very thin path runs along a stream between two tall mossy banks, so narrow that the friends must walk in a line, one behind the other; at the end of the path stands a small round door in a rock wall with the two letters t and h carved on it — the ONLY text allowed in the picture. Bun walks first, wobbling with her arms out; Hedgie holds on to Bun's boots; Beads rides on Hedgie's flower; Pip says the two letters apart; Pim and Pam fly overhead side by side. Up in the trees, Grumble's lantern glows, and a soft brown moth flutters around it. Hidden in the picture: the thin path, the moth.",
        "hidden": [
          "path",
          "thin",
          "moth"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "bun",
            "text": "This path is thin!",
            "audio": "b3_u03_l1",
            "ko": "이 길은 너무 가늘어!"
          },
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "Look! That is a moth.",
            "audio": "b3_u03_l2",
            "ko": "봐! 저건 나방이야."
          },
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "T... h...? T... h...?",
            "audio": "b3_u03_l3",
            "ko": "트… 흐…? 트… 흐…?"
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b3_u03_1",
        "ko": "해질녘, 시냇가의 아주 가느다란 오솔길을 한 줄로 걸어요. 끝에 t·h 문이 있어요. 그럼블의 등불 둘레에 나방이 팔랑팔랑.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "Is the path big or thin?",
            "ko": "길은 넓어, 가늘어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What flies at the lantern?",
            "ko": "등불 둘레에 뭐가 날아?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u03_2",
        "desc": "Pim and Pam land at the end of the thin path and say the sound together, and the little round door in the rock swings open with a soft glow. Beads holds up a string of three beads. But the moth, drawn by the glow, zooms down past Grumble's lantern, and Grumble, swatting at it from his branch, loses his balance — his slippers fly up as he topples. Hidden in the picture: the thin path, the moth.",
        "hidden": [
          "path",
          "thin",
          "moth"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "twins",
            "text": "Together! /θ/ /θ/ thin!",
            "audio": "b3_u03_l4",
            "pop": "th",
            "ko": "함께! /θ/ /θ/ 가늘다!"
          },
          {
            "who": "beads",
            "text": "/θ/ /ɪ/ /n/ thin!",
            "audio": "blend_thin",
            "pop": "thin",
            "ko": "/θ/ /ɪ/ /n/ 가는!"
          },
          {
            "who": "grumble",
            "text": "Shh! Go, moth! Oh no!",
            "audio": "b3_u03_l5",
            "ko": "쉿! 저리 가, 나방아! 어어!"
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b3_u03_2",
        "ko": "핌과 팜이 함께 /θ/! 바위 문이 스르르 열려요. 그런데 나방이 그럼블에게 날아들고, 그럼블이 휘휘 쫓다가 미끄러져요!",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "What opens?",
            "ko": "뭐가 열렸어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What happens to Grumble?",
            "ko": "그럼블은 어떻게 됐어?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u03_3",
        "desc": "Splat! Grumble has landed in a big mud puddle beside the thin path, covered in mud from ears to tail, his nightcap drooping, his lantern held up safely in one paw; the moth sits on his nose. Bun and Hedgie run over; Pip hops beside him, beak open, the sounds coming out apart again. Hidden in the picture: the moth on Grumble's nose, the thin path.",
        "hidden": [
          "moth",
          "path"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Splat! Mud, mud, mud!",
            "audio": "b3_u03_l6",
            "ko": "철퍼덕! 진흙투성이!"
          },
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "Ba... t... h...?",
            "audio": "b3_u03_l7",
            "ko": "배… 트… 흐…?"
          },
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "Yes! A bath! A bath!",
            "audio": "b3_u03_l8",
            "ko": "맞아! 목욕! 목욕!"
          }
        ],
        "ko": "철퍼덕! 그럼블이 진흙 웅덩이에 빠졌어요. 핍이 \"배… 트… 흐…?\" 헤지가 \"맞아, 목욕!\"",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "Where is Grumble?",
            "ko": "그럼블은 어디 빠졌어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What does Grumble need?",
            "ko": "그럼블에게 뭐가 필요해?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u03_4",
        "desc": "Night by the stream. Grumble sits in a big round wooden bathtub full of warm foamy bubbles, only his head and nightcap showing, eyes half closed with a tiny happy smile; his lantern hangs on a branch above, and the moth sits calmly on it. Hedgie pours warm water from a bucket; Bun gives Grumble a big thumbs-up with her paw; Pim and Pam sit on the rim of the tub; Pip splashes in the bubbles. Hidden in the picture: the bath, the moth, the thumbs-up, the thin path.",
        "hidden": [
          "bath",
          "moth",
          "thumb",
          "path"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "grumble",
            "text": "Shh... This bath is hot.",
            "audio": "b3_u03_l9",
            "ko": "쉿… 이 목욕물 따뜻하네."
          },
          {
            "who": "bun",
            "text": "Thumbs up, Grumble!",
            "audio": "b3_u03_l10",
            "ko": "최고야, 그럼블!"
          },
          {
            "who": "twins",
            "text": "Together! Ha, ha, ha!",
            "audio": "b3_u03_l11",
            "ko": "함께! 하하하!"
          }
        ],
        "ko": "밤, 커다란 나무 욕조에서 그럼블이 거품 목욕을 해요. \"이 목욕물 따뜻하네.\" 번이 엄지 척! 나방은 등불 위에 얌전히 앉았어요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "Who is in the bath?",
            "ko": "누가 목욕을 해?"
          },
          {
            "en": "Is the bath hot?",
            "ko": "목욕물은 따뜻해?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "synopsis_ko": "해질녘, 아주 가느다란 오솔길 끝에 t·h 문이 있어요. 핌과 팜이 함께 /θ/! 문이 열려요. 그런데 나방을 쫓던 그럼블이 진흙에 철퍼덕! 친구들이 따뜻한 거품 목욕을 만들어 주자 그럼블이 살짝 웃어요.",
    "so_far_ko": "다람쥐가 가져간 점심을 ch 소리로 되찾고, 그럼블에게도 감자칩을 나눠 줬어요.",
    "goal_ko": "th /θ/ 를 말해 바위 문을 열고 그럼블을 도와줘요."
  },
